Not _randomly_ generated outside Gehennom. This refers only to the regular
"give me a monster, any monster" thing the game does, calling rndmonst()
in makemon.c.

The Castle throneroom contains 27 monsters, roughly equally chosen from
EHLMNORTXZ. Monsters generated with specific levels are created with
mkclass which does not respect Hell restrictions.

If you've been to the Castle any significant number of times you will know
- possibly by painful experience - that master liches can appear there.
